[00:21.686]Your voice takes a form I'll never be able to hold
{"你的声音化作我永远无法触及的形态"}
[00:26.845]Yet your presence seems to shelter me from the cold
{"但你的存在仿佛为我隔绝了严寒"}
[00:31.905]But like the glitter in a snow globe we'll eventually fall
{"可就像水晶球里的亮片终将坠落"}
[00:36.917]Despite the beauty surrounding it all
{"即便周遭尽是美好景象"}
[00:42.031]We're just a centimetre apart
{"我们仅相隔一厘米"}
[00:45.788]But that's the gap I can't close between our hearts
{"却是两颗心永远无法跨越的距离"}
[00:52.003]We're two worlds destined to never meet
{"我们是永无交会的两个世界"}
[00:56.492]And you're the one I'll never reach
{"你是我永远触碰不到的彼岸"}
[01:02.044]We're just a centimetre apart
{"我们仅相隔一厘米"}
[01:06.075]But even if I reach out I'll phase right through
{"即便伸手也会穿透你的幻影"}
[01:12.325]This time we have may only be temporary
{"此刻的相聚或许只是短暂"}
[01:16.740]But on the contrary
{"但矛盾的是"}
[01:18.733]are these feelings that I harbour for you
{"这份为你悸动的心情"}
[02:02.909]I could be on the world's highest building
{"纵使站在世界最高楼顶"}
[02:07.244]But never flinch nor shed a tear, because
{"也不会退缩落泪 只因"}
[02:13.012]My only fear is the fear of losing you
{"我唯一的恐惧是失去你"}
[02:22.980]Another centimetre apart
{"又远了一厘米"}
[02:26.868]You can leave but please don't leave me in the dark
{"你可以离开 但别留我在黑暗里"}
[02:33.124]I know you'll never see me that way
{"明知你永远不会那样注视我"}
[02:36.931]But I hope you'll stay, just for one more day
{"仍祈求你多停留一日光阴"}
[02:43.228]We're just a centimetre apart
{"我们仅相隔一厘米"}
[02:47.012]But that's the gap I can't close between our hearts
{"却是两颗心永远无法跨越的距离"}
[02:53.252]We're two worlds destined to never meet
{"我们是永无交会的两个世界"}
[02:57.773]And you're the one I'll never reach
{"你是我永远触碰不到的彼岸"}
[03:03.508]We're just a centimetre apart
{"我们仅相隔一厘米"}
[03:07.212]But do I still persist this love that can't exist
{"但我为何仍执着于这无果的爱恋"}
[03:13.523]I know that all this'll do is leave a scar
{"明知这一切只会留下伤痕"}
[03:17.972]But that only gives me a reason to reminisce
{"却偏偏给了我追忆的理由"}
[04:04.131]We're just a centimetre apart
{"我们之间仅咫尺之遥"}
[04:07.779]Why do I still persist this love that can't exist
{"为何我仍执着于这无果的爱恋"}
[04:14.012]I know that all this'll do is leave a scar
{"明知这一切只会留下伤痕"}
